OL,3,GNEWSAScabies outbreak at hospital
OL,4,Acloses wards
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Welsh hospital has restricted
OL,7,Fvisitors and closed two wards following
OL,8,Fan outbreak of scabies.
OL,10,FHywel Dda health board said the wards
OL,11,Fat Prince Philip Hospital in Llanelli,
OL,12,FCarmarthenshire, were currently closed
OL,13,F"due to infection", with restrictions
OL,14,Fon visitors put in place on Sunday to
OL,15,Flimit the spread.
OL,17,FScabies is a highly contagious skin
OL,18,Finfestation caused by microscopic mites
OL,19,Fthat burrow under the skin and spread
OL,20,Fthrough close skin contact, according
OL,21,Fto the NHS.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,434,430,260,140,0,100
