OL,3,GNEWSAScabies outbreak at hospital
OL,4,Acloses wards
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe health board said a number of cases
OL,7,Fwere being managed in healthcare and
OL,8,Fcommunity settings across its area -
OL,9,Fwhich covers Carmarthenshire,
OL,10,FCeredigion, and Pembrokeshire - but the
OL,11,Frisk to the wider public remained low.
